# What NOT to upload to Vercel.
#
# Deploys run from the repo ROOT (each project sets its own Root Directory to
# apps/<name>), so without this file every deploy would upload the whole
# working tree — including ~130MB of raw phone footage that no site serves.
#
# Anything a site actually serves lives under apps/*/public and is NOT listed
# here.

node_modules
.next
out

# Raw source photos and video straight off the phone. The files the sites
# serve were copied into apps/*/public; these originals are the archive.
Images/

# Reference repos cloned for inspiration.
references/

# Research dumps and the old 2.0 source text.
notes/

# Credentials. Belt and braces — these are in .gitignore too, but .vercelignore
# is what governs what leaves this machine on a deploy.
vercell.txt
vercel.txt
*token*.txt
*.token
.env
.env*.local

# Local build artefacts
*.tsbuildinfo
